      "has_proof": false,
      "statement_event": 23,
      "proof_event": null,
      "proof_chapter": null,
      "proof_leanok": false,
      "text": "The {\\bf $\\eval$ function} is defined by \\begin{align} \\eval : G^d & \\to \\Bool \\\\ x & \\mapsto \\begin{cases} 1 & \\text{ if } \\sum_i x_i = 0 \\\\ 0 & \\text{ else} \\end{cases} \\end{align}"
    },
    {
